# Step 11: Attach ASG to Target Group

During Auto Scaling Group creation:

1. Select **Attach to an existing load balancer**.
2. Select the Application Load Balancer Target Group.

Architecture:

```text
Application Load Balancer
          |
          v
     Target Group
          |
    Auto Scaling Group
          |
    +-----+-----+
    |           |
    v           v
  Web EC2     Web EC2
```

When the ASG launches a new instance:

```text
New EC2 Instance
       |
       v
Automatically registered
       |
       v
ALB Target Group
       |
       v
ALB starts sending traffic
```

---

# Step 12: Configure Auto Scaling Policy

Configure a **Target Tracking Scaling Policy**.

Example:

```text
Metric: Average CPU Utilization
Target Value: 70%
```

Scaling behavior:

```text
CPU Usage Increases
        |
        v
CloudWatch Metric
        |
        v
Auto Scaling Policy
        |
        v
ASG Launches New EC2 Instance
```

When CPU utilization decreases:

```text
CPU Usage Decreases
        |
        v
ASG Terminates Unnecessary Instances
```

